## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design robust, scalable planning and tool orchestration using LangChain and AutoGen. It probes how the candidate decomposes a data pipeline, handles failures, and produces auditable output.

## Key Concepts

- Autogen-driven planning: generate stepwise execution plans with fallback paths
- LangChain Tools and Chains: sequential tool execution, error handling, and tracing
- Data integrity: deduplication, normalization, and deterministic scoring

